      "id": "python-concurrency-network-urllib-c01",
      "type": "code",
      "prompt": "读取 URL 文本并去掉首尾空白。仅当 scheme 为 https、hostname 为 example.test、无用户名密码、端口未指定或为 443，且输入不含空白或反斜杠时输出 True；否则输出 False，均正常结束。主机名大小写不敏感，路径与查询不参与判断。使用 urlsplit，不发起请求。端口解析错误也返回 False。",
      "starter_code": "import sys\ntext = sys.stdin.read().strip()\nfrom urllib.parse import urlsplit\n# 按题面实现本课操作\n",
      "visible_tests": [
        "输入 'https://example.test/a'，输出 'True\\n'，退出码 0。",
        "输入 'http://example.test/a'，输出 'False\\n'，退出码 0。"
      ],
      "experience_points": 15,
      "private": {
        "reference_solution": "import sys\ntext = sys.stdin.read().strip()\nfrom urllib.parse import urlsplit\ntry:\n    url = urlsplit(text)\n    valid = bool(text) and not any(c.isspace() for c in text) and \"\\\\\" not in text and url.scheme == \"https\" and url.hostname == \"example.test\" and url.username is None and url.password is None and url.port in (None, 443)\nexcept ValueError:\n    valid = False\nprint(valid)\n",
        "hidden_tests": [
          "检查题面规定的有效边界和失败行为。",
          "输出格式、类型和顺序以题面约定为准。"
